      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Gulf Oil Company began a refinery in Hooven in 1931, producing jet fuel, diesel, gasoline, and home\u2011heating oil.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hooven%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Chevron acquired the refinery in 1985 and closed it in 1986, eliminating over 200 jobs and shaking the local economy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hooven%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Since the closure, Chevron has been negotiating with the EPA and cleaning up contaminated soil and groundwater at the former site.",
